// "triple <subject>'s power [<duration>]": To triple a creature's power, it gets +X/+0, where X is twice its power [CR#701.11b,701.11c]. One expansion of the
// "triple" keyword action, which has several, chosen by what is tripled
// [CR#701.10a,701.11a].
(
    name: "triplePower",
    kinds: [Instruction],
    params: {"subject": Subject, "duration": Default(Any, None)},
    body: Establish(PtModification(Param(subject), up(times(2, powerOf(Param(subject)))), up(0)), Param(duration)),
)
